      "text": "VIEWPORT TRANSFORM\n(NDC -> Screen Coordinates)",
      "fontSize": 78.27384653132853,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VIEWPORT TRANSFORM\n(NDC -> Screen Coordinates)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5HVUuWaGpI2NiyOxpybW3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1091.1795727419928,
      "y": 4508.212087833934,
      "width": 988.8991088867188,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 996847433,
      "version": 197,
      "versionNonce": 599952521,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785515411568,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The last step: we have to fit those vertex into the screen. For that purpose, we have to transform\nthe NDC coordinates to screen coordinates.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The last step: we have to fit those vertex into the screen. For that purpose, we have to transform\nthe NDC coordinates to screen coordinates.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BJNpmcaVMyADEEtZEUhH5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1230.7559784251848,
      "y": 4595.631281397323,
      "width": 1092.8590087890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 332250697,
      "version": 107,
      "versionNonce": 815598505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785515443060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For this, a VIEWPORT TRANSFORM is used, which is also called screen transform or NDC-to-screen transform.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For this, a VIEWPORT TRANSFORM is used, which is also called screen transform or NDC-to-screen transform.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
